iagrams. Existing non-generated directories are never replaced. The website publishes and tests a generated refund example.\n\n## Implementation evidence\n\nMoved to implemented on 2026-09-09 after an audit of every non-implemented artifact against `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/roadmap.md` and the crates.\n\n`entity generate docs` writes index and per-entity HTML/Markdown, OpenAPI 3.2 and AsyncAPI 3.1 in JSON and YAML, replaces only generator-owned output, and the refund reference is published with the site — `CHANGELOG.md` `## [0.16.0]`; `crates/entity-surface`.\n","relations":[{"derived_from":"epic:generated-entity-surfaces"},{"depends_on":"story:multi-format-entity-graphs"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"A definition set becomes a standalone human reference with OpenAPI and AsyncAPI in YAML and JSON.","title":"Generate entity documentation and API contracts"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"},"relations":[{"derived_from":"epic:generated-entity-surfaces"},{"depends_on":"story:multi-format-entity-graphs"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"summary":"A definition set becomes a standalone human reference with OpenAPI and AsyncAPI in YAML and JSON.","title":"Generate entity documentation and API contracts"},"id":"ent-9e4daf2887186d9d093acff069f70ef4","lifecycle_state":"implemented","revision":6,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["story","ent-9e4daf2887186d9d093acff069f70ef4"]}]